  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Azure Cosmos DB — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for Container operations, plus a built-in CosmosTransientErrors predicate covering rate limiting (429), timeouts (408), partition failovers (410), and service unavailability (503).",
