  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientCosmosContainer wraps Azure Cosmos DB Container operations in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Includes CosmosTransientErrors helper with pre-built ShouldHandle predicate covering rate limiting (429), timeouts (408), partition splits (410), and service unavailability (503). Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
